+features:
+  - |
+    Added a new `CSVDocumentSplitter` component to the preprocessors module. This component splits a CSV
+    document into multiple sub-tables by detecting consecutive empty rows and/or columns that exceed a
+    configurable threshold, making it easier to work with CSV files that contain several tables.
